    "Review the exact revision range from the previously reviewed design source d90de60f98b8e187e2f75bcab697c6f3e747462d through 395c5d62975ba0f52e0da69af256ef870bf02770.",
    "Confirm whether Technical Design v1.2.1, ADR-TS001-001 through ADR-TS001-004, Threat Model v1.2.1, and Benchmark Plan v1.1.0 preserve the prior ACCEPTED_WITH_GATES architecture disposition.",
