    "Check that the CSP, security-header, runtime request-inventory, pattern-data egress, network-capture, persistence-ordering, multi-tab, durability, worker-isolation, and Blob-lifecycle contracts are internally consistent and testable.",
    "Identify any product-meaning conflict, architectural regression, missing mandatory design control, or traceability defect introduced by the revision.",
    "Return an explicit revision disposition of CONFIRMED_ACCEPTED_WITH_GATES, REWORK_REQUIRED, or BLOCKED inside the report without assigning project VERIFIED status."
  ],
  "out_of_scope": [
    "Editing the canonical repository, Technical Design, ADRs, Threat Model, Benchmark Plan, Engineering Verification Report, product sources, fixtures, code, dependencies, GitHub settings, Cloudflare state, CI/CD, or deployment.",
    "Creating route-1 or route-2 fixtures, implementing the workspace or application, selecting concrete dependencies, configuring infrastructure, or deploying to abris.653915.com.",
